38202>>>>>>>        Else Begin
38203>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38204>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38205>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38206>>>>>>>        End
38206>>>>>>>>
38206>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
