39003>>>Object oDashboard is a cWebView
39005>>>
39005>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -  
39005>>>    // Add a DDO Structure 
39005>>>    //
39005>>>    // There is no need to synchronize a DD structure on the client so we do
39005>>>    // not set the Server property or send ADDOStructure. We will simply use
39005>>>    // DDO's to mine data and generate HTML for our cWebHTMLBox objects.
39005>>>    // It is the HTML in these objects that is sent to the client each time 
39005>>>    // this page is shown.
39005>>>    //
39005>>>    // Also, it is important for the drill-down Navigation interface that we
39005>>>    // do not set the Server property to some DDO because this will affect 
39005>>>    // constraints in the next view that we navigate to.
39005>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - 
39005>>>
